# Ignore ESP-IDF build outputs and common temp files

# ESP-IDF per-project build directories
**/build/

# ESP-IDF Component Manager downloads (generated locally)
**/managed_components/

# IDF generated backup config
**/sdkconfig.old

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Logs
*.log

# OS/editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.code-workspace
